</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">....WW...WW.
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">.........WW.
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">.........W..
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">..W......W..
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">.W.W.....WW.
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">W.W.W.....W.
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">.W.W......W.
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">..W.......W.</span></span></code></pre></div></div>
